  "body": "9 Harris Drive, Millwater\r\n\r\n4 Bed | 2.5 Bath | 3 Living | 2 Garage | Heated Swim Spa\r\n\r\nWelcome to a home designed for year-round living, entertaining and making memories.\r\n\r\nThe standout feature of this immaculate Millwater property is the impressive covered outdoor entertainment pavilion — a beautifully created space that allows you to entertain family and friends in every season.\r\n\r\nWhether it's summer BBQs, birthday celebrations, relaxing with friends on a winter evening or unwinding in the heated swim spa, this is an outdoor living space you'll enjoy 365 days a year. Surrounded by immaculate landscaped gardens, it creates your own private retreat right at home.\r\n\r\nInside, the home is equally impressive.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 540m² section with approximately 243m² of floor area, the layout has been designed with family living in mind. You'll find four spacious double bedrooms, two bathrooms plus a guest toilet, three generous living areas and a double internal-access garage.\r\n\r\nThe multiple living spaces provide plenty of room for the whole family, while the open-plan kitchen, dining and living areas connect seamlessly with the outdoor entertainment zone.\r\n\r\nBeautifully maintained and presented, this home is completely move-in ready. The current owners have taken enormous pride in both the home and gardens, creating a property that feels special from the moment you arrive.\r\n\r\nPositioned in sought-after Millwater, you're within easy reach of the Northern Motorway, local shops, cafés, parks, schools and everything the wider Silverdale and Orewa area has to offer.\r\n\r\nDue to a change in circumstances, the vendors are ready to pass this much-loved home on to its next family.\r\n\r\nCome for the home. Stay for the lifestyle.\r\n\r\nAUCTION — 24 SEPTEMBER 2026 (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nDon't miss the opportunity to secure this immaculate Millwater entertainer.\r\n\r\nContact Team Steenberg today to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes.\r\n\r\nNo Stress. Just Success.",
